    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157">

                <pb facs="0198" n="164" xml:id="pg164"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Patenôtre to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >French Embassy</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic">June 5,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: The new note which you
                    have done me the honor to address me to-day, for transmission to the Compagnie
                    Française des Câbles Télégraphiques, reached me this evening. I immediately sent
                    a copy of it, as you requested, to the said company’s representative at New
                    York.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Patenôtre.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
